  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "聲音印象與賞析",
    "sub_ename": "VOICE IMPRESSION AND APPRECIATION",
    "describe_ch": "在生活中，為什麼有些人總能無往不利？有些人卻處處碰壁？\n是運氣不好嗎？或許吧！然而運氣的好壞、有一大部分是可以自主控制的，例如聲音…\n聲音能夠觸動人心、引發認同，聲音也可以讓人敬謝不敏、避而遠之。我能夠擁有更好的聲音嗎？當然可以啊！只要知道方法。\n從賞析聲音、認識自己的聲音開始，本課程將帶領學子探索聲音的奧妙與美好，並且建構自我的聲音印象，開創更美好的人生！",
    "describe_eh": "In our lives, why are some people popular? Some people are not popular? \nIs it bad luck? Maybe! However, a large part of the good or bad luck can be controlled autonomously, such as by voice.\nVoice can win the favor of others, and voice can also make others disgusted. So, can I have a better voice? Absolutely, if you know the method.\nStarting from appreciating the voice, and recognizing students’ own voice, this course will lead students to explore the mystery and beauty of voice, and construct their own voice impression to create a better life!",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "探索聲音的奧妙，發現聲音的美麗與魔力，奠定未來朝向口語溝通等領域發展的基礎。",
      "describe_en": "Explore the wonders of voice, discover the beauty and magic of voice, and develop into areas such as spoken communication in the future."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "發展自我的聲音特質，提升口語表達效果，建立更良好的人際溝通印象。",
      "describe_en": " Develop students’ own voice characteristics, improve oral expression, and establish a better impression in interpersonal communication."
    }
