  "gradeRuleDescribe": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 2.0,
    "cls_id": "XC04111",
    "sub_id": "GM779",
    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>平時成績 : 40%，包含 1.平時作業 20% 2.出席率(每次課程都會點名) 20% 期中考 : 30% 製作廣播節目 期末考 : 30% 節目主持(由同學自行設計)，與說話表達輔導</div>\n\n<div>課堂參與列為加分項目。</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": " ",
    "course_pol": "課堂禮儀\n1.請展現包容性，對來自不同地區的同學，請尊重多元文化，勿嘲諷其發音或口音。\n2.課程討論及互動，請以尊重的態度，欣賞每位同學的個人經歷、背景和觀點。\n課堂行為\n上課請守時\n繳交作業請準時\n課堂討論請盡量融入並參與\n課堂是學習的殿堂，上課中請勿聊天嬉戲或睡覺\n同學如有事情須提早下課，請提前告知。",
    "course_pol_en": "Classroom etiquette\n1. Please be inclusive, respect multiculturalism for students from different regions, and do not ridicule their pronunciation or accent.\n2. Please be respectful of each student's personal experience, background and perspective.\nClassroom behavior\nPlease be punctual in class\nPlease submit your homework on time\nPlease try to be as involved and involved as possible in class discussions\nThe classroom is a temple of learning, so please do not chat, play or sleep during class\nIf you have something to do with the class, please let us know in advance.",
    "course_rem": "1.請學習使用正向溝通法，進行課堂交流。\n2.課堂中設有互動學習時間，可進行師生雙向交流。\n3.有任何學習問題，可透過電子信箱隨時進行討論。",
    "course_rem_en": "1. Learn how to use positive communication to communicate in class.\n2. There is an interactive learning time in the classroom, which can be used for two-way communication between teachers and students.\n3. If you have any learning questions, you can discuss them at any time through your e-mail.",
    "ais_meno": "<div>由於本課程之作業，皆為原創作品</div>\n\n<div>同學必須要有自己的原創作品</div>\n\n<div>因此並無學術誠信的問題</div>\n\n<div>惟請同學在創作作品時</div>\n\n<div>須注意倫理問題</div>\n\n<div>不要有歧視、謾罵、諷刺等不當言論</div>\n\n<div>作品須展現人文關懷精神與價值</div>\n\n<div>發揮通識之博雅涵養</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": "<div><strong>As the assignments in this course are all original works</strong></div>\n\n<div><strong>Students must have their own original work</strong></div>\n\n<div><strong>Therefore, there is no question of academic integrity</strong></div>\n\n<div><strong>However, students are invited to create their works</strong></div>\n\n<div><strong>Attention must be paid to ethical issues</strong></div>\n\n<div><strong>Do not make inappropriate remarks such as discrimination, abuse, sarcasm, etc</strong></div>\n\n<div><strong>The work must show the spirit and value of humanistic care</strong></div>\n\n<div><strong>Give full play to the liberal arts of general knowledge</strong></div>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
  },
